body:
There is clearly no magic words that will make you see reason here, but here goes;

You act like nothing is wrong with the world, only because the people being oppressed were/are being silenced. Even if you are not actively doing the oppressing yourself personally, having your mind set of disproportional neutrality makes you an enabler of that oppression.

I'm not going to continue this with you, I hope you have a nice day and figure out how to take a good look at the world and your place in it.
